  "details": "Currently Group instances completely take away controll of the world creator making it so that group lobbies can kick the WORLD CREATOR from the instance , i dont think it should be like this , if i as the world creator see that someone is doing something malicious within one of my worlds i wanna be able to kick them from the world no matter the instance type.\n\nIt cant be that i create a world and other people have more controll abt certain instances than i do, i have had countless people claim they are \"official\" world moderators which straight up is wrong and should not be happening\n\nFurhter more althoug vrchat has introduced EAC there is still countless crasher / rippers / etc , and if i see one within my world i wanna be able to protect my users and me straight up not beeing able to even \"warn\" them is just crazy\n\nFurthermore i think it should be the world creators decision to allow / complete not allow group public lobbies (Group Friends or so are fine).\n\nVrchat is moving towards consumers which is great but moving away from creators / we are beeing left behind , moderation tools for us are mediocre at best and not existing at worst.\n\nBring more moderation tools to us world creator , make it so we have FINALLY have controll abt our creations and can protect our users.",
